            "claim_text_sha256": "73d962639c3d5949432821122670df9dc12d1f0f23a4e74a1bd8aa7663db924b"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Google describes Cloud HSM as a managed cluster of FIPS 140-2 Level 3 certified HSMs; Google manages clustering, scaling and patching. This certification statement concerns the HSM service, not a certification of an entire Atlas deployment. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-22)",
          "source": "https://cloud.google.com/kms/docs/hsm",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:9921d7d59e18b56b851013ad79e58828e69b29cb19baa9c2ede882a83a65b8de",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:113c8d089eb1628c651cd4a53fce6e58aaa8bc1c13264344ea4ed06b3e3926ca"
          ],
          "also": [
            "https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/inside-google-cloud/architecting-for-database-encryption-on-google-cloud"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atlas requires an M10-or-larger cluster, a symmetric KMS key and its fully qualified CryptoKeyVersion resource ID. Configure customer key management for the project, then enable it on each intended cluster. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/security-gcp-kms.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:3df71c40fab9a812d14b1b063454ed514b5244f9f7471a71d04b5da46c09fc3b",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
            "ev:2c477dc802299c2e445e350cf6c6e4c92bcdaad1e68362fc21f87d2c12792857",
            "ev:4851988e23e0223187137889b5042205808f571f79e543f8af32b813431b82b8",
            "ev:4cad6c03362d9275e87313f7de42305efbe7074cf2a932a34f0d87d13334297f",
            "ev:f4ac5e38be832f55392188a4ea1f30f19826cddd8327bd5c289600437294317b"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Revoking Atlas access to its customer-managed key can shut down cluster nodes. Keep the original key version enabled until rotation deploys and no retained backup snapshot needs it. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/security-gcp-kms.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:d5ec9a631ee5c783e575c41dabae61635e40a060388468393d4ccdabaa9bf3ab",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
