            "ev:f4387815dfa6f944154704230069914a81fb17299f4b201ff34efb188b2e1eb2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Google documents creation of a symmetric HSM key with gcloud kms keys create, --purpose encryption and --protection-level hsm; Atlas separately requires the resulting key-version resource identifier. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23) Sources: https://cloud.google.com/kms/docs/hsm ; https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/security-gcp-kms.md",
          "source": "https://cloud.google.com/kms/docs/hsm",
